Poinsettias for Christmas is a romance, tv movie
film directed by Christie Will Wolf.

2
00:06:26,666 --> 00:06:32,666
It’s just weeks before Christmas when Ellie gets a call to return home
to help her father on the family’s poinsettia farm.

3
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:46,000
The family business is on the line to deliver tens of
thousands of plants for the town’s annual parade.

4
